      'Scoring check: Team placement scoring: 1st+2nd place team +2 each; 1st+3rd +1 each; 2nd+4th or 1st+4th no score; 3rd+4th -2 each. Lone player vs three: 1st +6, 4th -3; others 0 or -2/+1. Scores doubled if red 10s exposed (running), quadrupled if other team calls stop. Scores sum to zero; often played for stakes. Expected outcome: 10.',
